1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,460
Welcome to Northwind, a planning tool built specifically for small studios

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:10,920
and independent teams. Northwind brings together the schedules, budgets,

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:16,380
task boards, time tracking, invoices, client notes and reporting you reach

4
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:21,840
for every week, all in one place. The idea is simple: to make the

5
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:27,300
information you frequently need easier to find and easier to use. From the

6
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:32,760
home screen, Northwind is organised into six main sections. We have

7
